                'Purposes: quick total of trade receivables/payables, helps locate errors to one ledger, deters fraud (a different person keeps the control account), and gives figures for incomplete records.',
                'Sources: sales journal (credit sales), sales returns journal, cash book (receipts, payments, discounts, dishonoured cheques, refunds), general journal (irrecoverable debts, contras, interest on overdue accounts).',
