                'Command words: Define (precise meaning), Describe (main features), Explain (reasons/how, with evidence), Discuss (in depth, structured), Evaluate (judge quality or importance), Assess (informed judgement), Justify (support with argument), Suggest (apply knowledge to a new situation).',
