                'Limiting factors: light intensity, carbon dioxide concentration and temperature; the factor in shortest supply limits the rate.',
                'Leaf adaptations: thin (short diffusion distance), broad (large surface area), palisade layer packed with chloroplasts, air spaces in spongy mesophyll, stomata for gas exchange.',
                'Balanced diet: carbohydrates, fats, proteins, vitamins C and D, minerals calcium and iron, fibre and water. Deficiencies: scurvy (vitamin C), rickets (vitamin D/calcium), anaemia (iron).',
                'Digestion: mechanical (teeth, churning) and chemical (enzymes). Amylase: starch → simple sugars; protease: protein → amino acids; lipase: fats → fatty acids + glycerol.',
