                'Travel agents (online, retail, specialist, business) sell packages and independent components plus ancillary services (insurance, currency, car hire).',
                'Tour operators assemble package holidays: all-inclusive, mass market, specialist, dynamic packaging (customer builds their own package online).',
                'Accommodation: hotels, guest houses/B&Bs, hostels, homestays, camping, luxury, budget, eco-friendly, serviced apartments; serviced (full board, half board, B&B, room only) or self-catering (home sharing, holiday lets).',
                'Occupancy rate (%) = rooms occupied ÷ rooms available × 100.',
                'Other providers: food and drink, visitor attractions (natural, built, events), ancillary services (guided tours, currency exchange, car/bicycle hire).',
